	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17693"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=206" title="View the profile of A Mammal">A Mammal</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 165<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.webpost.net/qu/quicksilver320/DPS.bmp" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Please Drive Threw!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=206"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg17693#msg17693"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg17693#msg17693">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #153 on:</b> July 02, 2005, 02:03:07 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">1. Vis Maior<br />2. Wraith / Reviviscence<br />3. DA / EiE<br />4. Cold Fury<br />5. Conviction<br />6. Dawning Nemesis<br />7. Moonlight Crusaders<br />8. Inner Loop<br />9. Underguild<br />10. Union of Power<br /></div><br />Being in Vis Maior I&#039;d Rank Wraith/Reviv over us atm cause they have killed Vishimtar the Fallen. We have killed Kessdona and they haven&#039;t but really if they spent anytime on the event I am sure they could kill it as well. While Vis has just started working on Vishimtar best we have got him is in the 30&#039;s. Wraith/Reviv spent quite a bit of time on the encounter, and I am sure Vis Maior will get it down soon enough, but atm they are definately ahead. Vishimtar makes Kessdona look like a moss snake_01 irl. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=726998" target="_blank">Infiltrator Corboy Chillin</a><br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=322842" target="_blank">Vicar Mamael Chillin</a><br />&quot;Last Chillin Standing.&quot;
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg17705"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
